1
00:00:01,450 --> 00:00:03,400
It's not that I don't want to meet people.

2
00:00:05,750 --> 00:00:07,100
I just don't know how to start.

3
00:00:10,200 --> 00:00:11,000
After I started working, I realized...

4
00:00:12,450 --> 00:00:14,000
Every day brings more new work.

5
00:00:15,742 --> 00:00:16,542
Not new people.

6
00:00:25,467 --> 00:00:26,267
Then I thought...

7
00:00:27,558 --> 00:00:29,358
Maybe I don't need to be someone else.

